    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming 1-Bedroom Cottage – Rialto Cottages, Dublin 8\r\n\r\nA delightful one-bedroom cottage offering a wonderful blend of traditional character and contemporary comfort, ideally positioned in a convenient city location.\r\n\r\nOn entering, the property immediately impresses with its warm and characterful living room, featuring a beautiful traditional fireplace with open fire, creating an inviting focal point. The room is further enhanced by timber flooring, adding warmth, texture and genuine cottage appeal. An attractive glazed timber internal door adds further character while allowing natural light to flow through the accommodation.\r\nThe property comprises a well-proportioned living room, double bedroom, bathroom with shower and fitted kitchen. \r\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a private paved patio garden area, providing a valuable outdoor space ideal for relaxing, or enjoying al fresco dining. \r\n\r\nIdeally located in Dublin 8, the property is within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities, cafés, restaurants, shops and recreational facilities, while Dublin city centre is readily accessible via excellent public transport links including the red line Luas just a short stroll away. \r\n\r\nThis delightful cottage is an excellent opportunity for those seeking a characterful and well-located home in a popular Dublin 8 setting."
      },
